  "question": {
    "text": "Five identical springs are used in the three configurations as shown in figure. The time periods of vertical oscillations in configurations (a), (b) and (c) are in the ratio.\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/q9Z8EDcO7jtbkD6-Rrs7FFufAIz4vFIYoX-vSKBURG4.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>",
    "image": null
