  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { } \\quad T_a=2 \\pi \\sqrt{\\frac{m}{k}} \\\\\n& T_b=2 \\pi \\sqrt{\\frac{m}{(k / 2)}} \\\\\n& T_c=2 \\pi \\sqrt{\\frac{m}{2 k}} \\\\\n& \\therefore \\quad T_a: T_b: T_c=1: \\sqrt{2}: \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\n\\end{aligned}$",
